{"fields":{"advisory":{"aliases":[],"categories":[],"collection":"crates","cvss":null,"date":"2024-10-07","description":"The creator of the crate `paste` has stated in the [`README.md`](https://github.com/dtolnay/paste/blob/master/README.md) \nthat this project is not longer maintained as well as archived the repository\n\n## Possible Alternative(s)\n\n- [`pastey`]: a fork of paste and is aimed to be a drop-in replacement with additional features for paste crate\n- [`with_builtin_macros`]: crate providing a [superset of `paste`'s functionality including general `macro_rules!` eager expansions](https://docs.rs/with_builtin_macros/0.1.0/with_builtin_macros/macro.with_eager_expansions.html)  and `concat!`/`concat_idents!` macros\n\n[`pastey`]: https://crates.io/crates/pastey\n[`with_builtin_macros`]: https://crates.io/crates/with_builtin_macros","expect-deleted":false,"id":"RUSTSEC-2024-0436","informational":"unmaintained","keywords":[],"license":"CC0-1.0","package":"paste","references":[],"related":[],"source":null,"title":"paste - no longer maintained","url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/paste","withdrawn":null},"code":"unmaintained","graphs":[{"Krate":{"name":"paste","version":"1.0.15"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"either_of","version":"0.1.9"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-components","version":"0.1.0"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs","version":"0.1.0"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs-cli","version":"0.1.10"}}]}]},{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs","version":"0.1.0"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-ui","version":"0.1.0"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-components","version":"0.1.0"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs","version":"0.1.0"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs-cli","version":"0.1.10"},"repeat":true}]}]},{"Krate":{"name":"tachys","version":"0.2.19"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"leptos_dom","version":"0.8.8"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"repeat":true}]},{"Krate":{"name":"leptos_server","version":"0.8.8"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"repeat":true}]}]}]},{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"reactive_graph","version":"0.2.15"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"leptos","version":"0.8.22"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"leptos_dom","version":"0.8.8"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"leptos_server","version":"0.8.8"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"reactive_stores","version":"0.4.4"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"tachys","version":"0.2.19"},"repeat":true}]},{"Krate":{"name":"tachys","version":"0.2.19"},"repeat":true}]},{"Krate":{"name":"reactive_stores","version":"0.4.4"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-components","version":"0.1.0"},"repeat":true},{"Krate":{"name":"tachys","version":"0.2.19"},"repeat":true}]}],"labels":[{"column":1,"line":162,"message":"unmaintained advisory detected","span":"paste 1.0.15 registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"}],"message":"paste - no longer maintained","notes":["ID: RUSTSEC-2024-0436","Advisory: https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2024-0436","The creator of the crate `paste` has stated in the [`README.md`](https://github.com/dtolnay/paste/blob/master/README.md) \nthat this project is not longer maintained as well as archived the repository\n\n## Possible Alternative(s)\n\n- [`pastey`]: a fork of paste and is aimed to be a drop-in replacement with additional features for paste crate\n- [`with_builtin_macros`]: crate providing a [superset of `paste`'s functionality including general `macro_rules!` eager expansions](https://docs.rs/with_builtin_macros/0.1.0/with_builtin_macros/macro.with_eager_expansions.html)  and `concat!`/`concat_idents!` macros\n\n[`pastey`]: https://crates.io/crates/pastey\n[`with_builtin_macros`]: https://crates.io/crates/with_builtin_macros","Announcement: https://github.