{"fields":{"advisory":{"aliases":[],"categories":[],"collection":"crates","cvss":null,"date":"2024-03-25","description":"The [repository](https://github.com/dtolnay/unsafe-libyaml) was archived by\nits owner on 2024-03-25 and is read-only. The last release is 0.2.11\n(March 2024).\n\n`unsafe-libyaml` is a machine translation of libyaml's C code into unsafe\nRust (c2rust). Bugs found in it will not be fixed upstream. It is used by\n`serde_yaml` (itself deprecated) and by forks such as `serde_yaml_ng`.\n\n## Alternatives\n\nConsider a YAML parser written in safe Rust, for example:\n\n- [saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/saphyr) ([serde-saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/serde-saphyr) for serde users)\n- [noyalib](https://crates.io/crates/noyalib)","expect-deleted":false,"id":"RUSTSEC-2024-0449","informational":"unmaintained","keywords":[],"license":"CC0-1.0","package":"unsafe-libyaml","references":[],"related":[],"source":null,"title":"unsafe-libyaml is unmaintained","url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/unsafe-libyaml","withdrawn":null},"code":"unmaintained","graphs":[{"Krate":{"name":"unsafe-libyaml","version":"0.2.11"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"serde_yaml_ng","version":"0.10.0"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs","version":"0.1.0"},"parents":[{"Krate":{"name":"rustify-docs-cli","version":"0.1.10"}}]}]}]}],"labels":[{"column":1,"line":279,"message":"unmaintained advisory detected","span":"unsafe-libyaml 0.2.11 registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"}],"message":"unsafe-libyaml is unmaintained","notes":["ID: RUSTSEC-2024-0449","Advisory: https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2024-0449","The [repository](https://github.com/dtolnay/unsafe-libyaml) was archived by\nits owner on 2024-03-25 and is read-only. The last release is 0.2.11\n(March 2024).\n\n`unsafe-libyaml` is a machine translation of libyaml's C code into unsafe\nRust (c2rust). Bugs found in it will not be fixed upstream. It is used by\n`serde_yaml` (itself deprecated) and by forks such as `serde_yaml_ng`.\n\n## Alternatives\n\nConsider a YAML parser written in safe Rust, for example:\n\n- [saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/saphyr) ([serde-saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/serde-saphyr) for serde users)\n- [noyalib](https://crates.io/crates/noyalib)","Announcement: https://github.com/dtolnay/unsafe-libyaml","Solution: No safe upgrade is available!"],"severity":"error"},"type":"diagnostic"}
